<title>UK: Sweden approves Zeneca's Zomig.</title>
<headline>Sweden approves Zeneca's Zomig.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pharmaceutical company Zeneca Group Plc said on Monday that the Swedish regulatory authority has approved the marketing of its migraine treatment Zomig.  </p>
<p>Sweden becomes the second country to approve Zomig after the UK granted approval on March 10.</p>
<p>London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
